There is a small problem with the NetHack.cnf file included in the
first official binary distribution for Amiga NetHack 3.1.3.  Near
line 24, change:
	PATH=NetHack:
to
	PATH=NetHack:;HackExe:
This is the problem that causes minefill.lev to not be found by the
game.

My apologies for this oversight.  Please continue to report bugs
to nethack-bugs@linc.cis.upenn.edu.
Ken Lorber
(for the Amiga NetHack Team)
